        {
          "id": 687167142,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This is trying to fix a problem caused by:  \n```\npreferences_dialog.cpp\n----------------------\nvoid PreferencesDialog::on_buttonBox_accepted()\n\n    write_language_prefs();\n    wsApp->loadLanguage(QString(language));\n```\nReloading the capture file after closing `Edit->Preferences...` to reset the title and status strings might be slow for large capture files.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0809ffc6d9d98013a1895132bc055c622830b8a20bfa49328f53d5eb4a1206cb?s=80&d=identicon",
